- sympy pitfalls found and fixed (for gatekeeper): (i) Matrix .D is Dirac conjugate in sympy 1.14, use .H for adjoint; (ii) sp.Matrix(sp.BlockMatrix(...)) stays a MatrixExpr (no entry fusion, reshape gives 1x1): build explicit blocks via row_join/col_join; (iii) sigma_2 must be [[0,-i],[i,0]] (real antisymmetric [[0,-1],[1,0]] squares to -I and breaks Clifford); (iv) Matrix([Matrix rows]) nests block-wise: use list(...) flat rows.
